<title>HONG KONG: Tian Teck Land interim profit up 11.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Tian Teck Land interim profit up 11.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 11.7   vs 10.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  2.8    vs 2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  55.65  vs 49.96</p>
<p>    Turnover		   296.19 vs 270.53</p>
<p>    Company name	     Tian Teck Land Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 14-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 January 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Tian Teck Land is an investment holding company with hotel, property rental and sales interests.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
